{"schema":"publicfunds.public-data/v1","kind":"prices","fuel":{"unit":"South African cents per litre","period":"month of the official price adjustment (prices change on the first Wednesday of the month)","grades":[{"id":"petrol_93_inland","label":"Leaded Replacement Petrol (LRP) 93, inland"},{"id":"petrol_95_coast","label":"Leaded Replacement Petrol (LRP) 95, coast"},{"id":"petrol_95_inland","label":"Unleaded Petrol (ULP) 95, inland"},{"id":"diesel_005_inland","label":"Diesel 0.05% sulphur, inland"},{"id":"diesel_005_coast","label":"Diesel 0.05% sulphur, coast"},{"id":"paraffin_coast","label":"Illuminating paraffin, coast"},{"id":"paraffin_inland","label":"Illuminating paraffin, inland"}],"about":["Petrol prices are regulated pump prices (inland = Gauteng, coast = coastal zones).","DMPR's history table heads the 93 inland column 'Leaded Replacement Petrol'. The October 2026 DMPR price breakdown gives one inland price for '93 ULP & LRP', equal to this column; whether the two grades shared a price in every earlier month is unknown.","The same 'Leaded Replacement Petrol' heading also covers the 95 coast column. The October 2026 breakdown gives one coastal price for '95 ULP & LRP', equal to this column; whether the two grades shared a price in every earlier month is unknown.","The 95 inland column sits under DMPR's 'Unleaded' heading (Unleaded Petrol, ULP). The October 2026 breakdown gives one inland price for '95 ULP & LRP' (3025.00 c/l), equal to this column; whether the two grades shared a price in every earlier month is unknown.","Diesel and illuminating paraffin are not regulated at the pump, so retail prices can differ from these official figures.","Months come from the loaded DMPR history tables; December 2025 comes from DMPR's December 2025 Fuel Regulations workbook (KE-012)."],"columns":["year","month","grade","cents_per_litre","src"],"rows":[[2019,1,"diesel_005_coast",1264.62,"2e3e1c90"],[2019,1,"diesel_005_inland",1313.42,"2e3e1c90"],[2019,1,"paraffin_coast",